        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The helper allows ExtrapRules to be more general. It is a ddc::detail::TypeSeq&lt;MinExtrapolationRule, MaxExtrapolationRule&gt; pairing the extrapolation rules applied below/above the boundary. Each may be one of the tags in the <ref refid="namespaceExtrapolationRule" kindref="compound">ExtrapolationRule</ref> namespace (e.g. <ref refid="namespaceExtrapolationRule_1a58088f206966c61e34f5fc92fcd3ddbe" kindref="member">ExtrapolationRule::Periodic</ref>) or a custom, already-concrete extrapolation rule class. </para>
